<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil’s Real Caps Best Week Since 2020 as Trabuco Lifts Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging-Market Stocks Snag Best Week Since June on Tech Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</link><description>巴里与贝西默信托公司首席执行官霍莉·麦克唐纳进行了交谈。他们讨论了她在巴西的工作经历，以及投资新兴市场如何塑造她的投资理念。他们还讨论了美元的持久强势，以及 Bessemer 如何从单一家族办公室发展成为一家价值 3000 亿美元的企业。他们还讨论了如何构建世代财富和缓和家庭冲突。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video'&gt;为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Managing $300B for Ultra Wealthy Families: Masters in Business with Holly MacDonald&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:14:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度央行加强黄金贷款审查，金价暴跌信号紧张</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度银行监管机构正在加强对该国 2470 亿美元黄金贷款行业的审查，因为金条价格大幅下跌削弱了贷方向借款人索取的抵押品。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain'&gt;印度央行加强黄金贷款审查，金价暴跌信号紧张&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：RBI Steps Up Gold Loan Scrutiny as Bullion Rout Signals Strain&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/rbi-steps-up-gold-loan-scrutiny-as-bullion-rout-signals-strain</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:39:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着谈判取得进展，艾森科特更接近领导以色列</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing</link><description>距离大选只剩下一周多的时间，加迪·艾森科特距离联盟的突破已经很近了，这可以确保他获得议会多数席位，并放松本杰明·内塔尼亚胡对以色列政治长达三年的控制。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing'&gt;随着谈判取得进展，艾森科特更接近领导以色列&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Eisenkot Edging Closer to Leading Israel With Talks Progressing&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/eisenkot-edging-closer-to-leading-israel-with-talks-progressing</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>